    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 120359041554917552, guid: 203484d5888c16e46a9930e46ad0bbaf, type: 3}
      propertyPath: noteText
      value: 'Though I don''t know who you are, I''ll certainly be gone by the time
        you see this piece of paper, perhaps escaped or failed.

        If it''s
        not too much trouble for you I suggest you wander the corridors first and
        mentally prepare yourself for the surroundings.

        I''ve left some
        notes in some of the rooms, if indeed anyone can still see them.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
